{"code":"001515","name":"SK증권우","market":"KOSPI","sector_name":"증권","sector_desc":"증권 중개·IB·자산관리. 증시 거래대금과 금리, 부동산 PF 리스크에 민감합니다.","desc":"동사는 1955년 설립되어 70여 년간 대한민국 자본시장과 함께 성장해 온 금융투자회사로, 1986년 유가증권시장에 상장하였으며 현재 57개의 비상장 종속회사를 보유하고 있음. 투자매매업, 투자중개업, 투자자문업, 투자일임업, 신탁업 등 금융투자업을 영위하며, IB부문에서는 증권 인수·주선, M&A 중개, 기업자금 조달 자문 등을 수행하고 있음. 지속적인 혁신과 차별화된 금융역량으로 자본시장 발전에 기여하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-19","n_days":298,"close":3830.0,"open":3900.0,"high":3900.0,"low":3770.0,"volume":2327,"amount":8912410.0,"ret_1d":1.5915,"gap":3.4483,"range_pct":3.3943,"ret_5":-0.2604,"ret_20":-5.665,"ret_60":-1.7949,"ret_120":-66.7535,"ret_250":-26.3462,"ma20":3933.25,"ma60":4073.5833,"ma120":5557.625,"ma200":6254.175,"close_vs_ma200":-38.7609,"close_vs_ma60":-5.9796,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-9.5395,"r2_60":0.0097,"slope_120":-88.3453,"r2_120":0.6247,"slope_250":-15.7225,"r2_250":0.0176,"high52":18900.0,"low52":3305.0,"pos_52w":3.3665,"dd_52w":-79.7354,"mdd_1y":-77.5873,"atr14_pct":3.5062,"vol_ann_60":78.1273,"vol_avg20":4698.4,"vol_ratio20":0.4953,"vr5":0.7409,"vr20":0.0205,"amount_avg5":26413228.0,"amount_avg20":18352868.5,"amount_avg60":41382782.1667,"obv_chg20":5.4476,"turnover_20":4.8035,"pv_eff_20":-1.1794,"rsi14":42.0305,"frgn_net_5":0.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":0.0,"frgn_net_20":465.0,"inst_net_20":0.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0238,"inst_net_20_pct":0.0,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0238,"frgn_net_60":377.0,"inst_net_60":1000.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0193,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0511,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0704,"frgn_net_120":-9919.0,"inst_net_120":1006.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.507,"inst_net_120_pct":0.0514,"smart_net_120_pct":-0.4556,"foreign_ratio":0.75,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.2,"smart_buy_streak":0,"op_income_q":225.0,"op_margin_q":2.2262,"op_qoq":-21.6028,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":378.7234,"rev_yoy":198.9352,"op_trend_4q":47.2393,"fin_period":"202606","roe":11.32,"debt_ratio":1191.67,"per":12.98,"pbr":1.22,"div_yield":null,"for